Grove original art
==================

All files under apps/web/public/art/ are original work created for Grove
(code name Aetheria). That covers the original 16-bit dusk-lantern floor tiles
and character sprites under tiles/ and chars/, and everything added since:

  buildings/     access-level structures (private / public_view / public_write)
  civic/         the six civic rooms (plaza, library, workshop, stage,
                 garden, board)
  scaffold/      construction, three stages
  tiles/ground/  calm 2:1 region ground tiles
  tiles/paths/   16-way path/road tiles
  tiles/scatter/ transparent ground-variety overlays
  props/         lanterns, benches, planters, crates, signposts, braziers
  animals/       sheep (idle, grazing, walking)
  items/         documents, tools, lamps, seedlings a body can carry

Everything in those directories is generated programmatically by
tools/generate_art.py -- polygons computed from the isometric projection, drawn
with Pillow. No asset here was downloaded, copied, traced or adapted from any
existing artwork. They are not derived from Metro City, LimeZu, Star Office
World, Pixel Agents, or any third-party sprite pack. Geometric CSS avatars
remain original.

See manifest.json for the full sprite/tile mapping, pixel sizes, anchors and
footprints, and README.md for the geometry, anchor convention and palette.
Side sprites (chars, animals) face viewer's right; flip in-engine for left.

License: Apache-2.0, same as the Grove repository, unless a file says otherwise.

Do not add third-party commercial-restricted sprite packs to this directory.
Do not hand-edit the generated PNGs -- change tools/generate_art.py and re-run
it, or the next run silently reverts your work.
